  "十一又四分之一月台": "Platform Eleven and a Quarter",
  "霍格華茲特快車從王十字車站的九又四分之三月台出發。哈利跟著衛斯理一家，第一次穿過通往月台的障壁。": "It leaves from Platform Nine and Three-Quarters at King’s Cross. Harry first follows the Weasleys through the barrier.",
  "分類帽最後將哈利分進哪一個學院？": "Which house does the Sorting Hat choose for Harry?",
  "分類帽考慮過史萊哲林，但也聽見哈利的意願，最後將他分進葛來分多。": "The Hat considers Slytherin, but listens to Harry’s wishes and places him in Gryffindor.",
  "海格送給哈利的雪鴞，後來取名叫什麼？": "What does Harry name the snowy owl Hagrid gives him?",
