  "妙麗當時躲在女廁，並不知道山怪闖入。這場危機讓三人建立起真正的友誼。": "Hermione is hiding in the girls’ bathroom, unaware of the troll. The incident begins the trio’s friendship.",
  "哈利在葛來分多魁地奇隊擔任什麼位置？": "What position does Harry play in Quidditch?",
