  "奧利凡德替哈利試過多根魔杖，最後選中他的，是冬青木、鳳凰羽毛杖芯的魔杖。": "A holly wand with a phoenix-feather core chooses Harry at Ollivanders.",
  "《消失的密室》中，到德思禮家警告哈利的家庭小精靈是誰？": "Which house-elf warns Harry at the Dursleys’ home in Chamber of Secrets?",
  "怪角": "Kreacher",
  "眨眨": "Winky",
  "郝琪": "Hokey",
  "多比為了阻止哈利回到危險的霍格華茲，偷偷來到德思禮家；他的好意卻讓哈利惹上不少麻煩。": "Dobby secretly visits to keep Harry away from danger, although his attempts cause trouble.",
  "哈利完整現形的護法，外形是哪一種動物？": "What animal is Harry’s corporeal Patronus?",
  "牡鹿": "A stag",
  "牝鹿": "A doe",
  "獺": "An otter",
  "哈利的護法是一頭牡鹿，與父親詹姆的化獸師形態相呼應。他在湖邊救下了自己與天狼星。": "The stag echoes James Potter’s Animagus form. At the lake, Harry uses it to save himself and Sirius.",
  "史萊哲林的密室中，潛藏著哪一種生物？": "Which creature lives in Slytherin’s Chamber?",
  "妙麗查出密室的怪物是蛇妖。遭遇者透過鏡面、相機等間接看見牠的眼睛，因此石化而沒有直接死亡。": "Hermione identifies the Basilisk. Indirect views through reflections or a camera cause petrification rather than death.",
  "意若思鏡真正顯示的是什麼？": "What does the Mirror of Erised show?",
  "最近遺失的物品": "A recently lost object",
  "一定會發生的未來": "A guaranteed future",
  "觀看者最恐懼的事": "The viewer’s greatest fear",
  "觀看者內心最深的渴望": "The viewer’s deepest desire",
  "意若思鏡映出心底最深的渴望，並不保證預言未來。哈利在鏡中見到家人，榮恩則看見獲得肯定的自己。": "The mirror reflects desire, not a guaranteed future. Harry sees his family, while Ron sees himself distinguished from his brothers.",
  "要讓守護活板門的三頭犬「毛毛」睡著，可以怎麼做？": "How can you make Fluffy fall asleep?",
  "餵牠南瓜汁": "Give him pumpkin juice",
  "演奏音樂": "Play music",
  "遮住三雙眼睛": "Cover all six eyes",
  "對牠鞠躬": "Bow to him",
  "毛毛聽見音樂就會入睡。三人利用這個弱點通過牠守護的活板門，音樂停下後牠便可能醒來。": "Music puts the three-headed dog to sleep, allowing the trio to reach the trapdoor. He can wake when it stops.",
  "正確調製的變身水，主要能讓飲用者做到什麼？": "What does properly prepared Polyjuice Potion primarily do?",
  "暫時變成另一個人的外貌": "Temporarily gives you another person’s appearance",
  "變成任何一種動物": "Turns you into any animal",
  "永久改變自己的年齡": "Permanently changes your age",
  "閱讀他人的記憶": "Lets you read another person’s memories",
  "變身水用來暫時變成另一個人，需要加入對方的身體成分，例如頭髮。妙麗誤用了貓毛，提醒我們它不適合跨物種變形。": "It temporarily changes the drinker into another person and needs material such as their hair. Hermione’s cat-hair accident shows why it is not intended for animals.",
  "路平教授教導學生，對付幻形怪要搭配什麼咒語與想像？": "Which spell and image does Lupin teach against a Boggart?",
  "路摸思，想像陽光": "Lumos, imagining sunshine",
  "溫咖癲啦唯啊薩，想像飛行": "Wingardium Leviosa, imagining flight",
  "叱叱，荒唐，想像滑稽的樣子": "Riddikulus, imagining something ridiculous",
  "阿咯哈呣啦，想像一扇門": "Alohomora, imagining a door",
  "Riddikulus（叱叱，荒唐）配合可笑的想像，可以改變幻形怪的外觀；笑聲是對付牠的重要力量。": "Riddikulus combines with a humorous image to transform the Boggart. Laughter is an important weapon against it.",
  "是誰把劫盜地圖交給哈利？": "Who gives Harry the Marauder’s Map?",
  "詹姆與天狼星": "James and Sirius",
  "弗雷與喬治": "Fred and George",
  "路平與鄧不利多": "Lupin and Dumbledore",
  "榮恩與妙麗": "Ron and Hermione",
  "弗雷與喬治把地圖送給哈利，讓他得以找出通往活米村的密道。他們先前從飛七的辦公室取得這張地圖。": "Fred and George give him the map, revealing secret passages to Hogsmeade. They obtained it from Filch’s office.",
  "《阿茲卡班的逃犯》中，妙麗用哪一樣物品兼顧同時上課的課表？": "What lets Hermione attend overlapping lessons in Prisoner of Azkaban?",
  "儲思盆": "A Pensieve",
  "消光器": "The Deluminator",
  "記憶球": "A Remembrall",
  "時光器": "A Time-Turner",
  "妙麗經由麥教授取得時光器，用它回到稍早的時間上另一堂課。後來她與哈利用同一件物品回到湖邊事件之前。": "McGonagall arranges a Time-Turner for Hermione. She later uses it with Harry to return to the events at the lake.",
  "三巫鬥法大賽第一項任務，哈利抽到的是哪一種龍？": "Which dragon does Harry face in the first Triwizard task?",
