  "魔法部的審判室": "A Ministry courtroom",
  "萬應室會依使用者的需要提供合適空間。哈利與同學們在這裡練習課堂上缺乏的實際防禦魔法。": "The Room of Requirement provides a space where students practise the practical defence missing from their lessons.",
  "史拉轟介紹的「福來福喜」，會帶來哪一種效果？": "What effect does Felix Felicis have?",
  "讓飲用者暫時變得幸運": "Temporarily makes the drinker lucky",
  "讓人短暫隱形": "Makes someone briefly invisible",
  "讓人墜入真正的愛情": "Creates genuine love",
  "讓人說出真話": "Makes someone tell the truth",
  "福來福喜又稱幸運藥水，能在一段時間內帶來好運。它不是萬能捷徑，小說也提到過量飲用及在比賽中使用的問題。": "It brings good luck for a limited time. Excessive use is dangerous and it is banned in competitions.",
  "假分靈體小金匣裡的署名「R.A.B.」，指的是誰？": "Who signs the note in the fake locket as R.A.B.?",
  "雷古勒斯・布萊克（Regulus Arcturus Black）": "Regulus Arcturus Black",
  "R.A.B. 是天狼星的弟弟 Regulus Arcturus Black（雷古勒斯・布萊克）。怪角的敘述揭開了他調換小金匣、反抗佛地魔的經過。": "Regulus is Sirius’s younger brother. Kreacher reveals how he replaced the locket and turned against Voldemort.",
  "哈利最後在哪裡找到雷文克勞的冠冕？": "Where does Harry find Ravenclaw’s diadem?",
  "古靈閣的金庫": "A Gringotts vault",
  "霍格華茲的湖底": "The bottom of the Hogwarts lake",
  "鄧不利多的墓中": "Dumbledore’s tomb",
  "萬應室堆放藏匿物品的空間": "The Room of Requirement’s hiding place",
  "冠冕藏在萬應室堆滿隱藏物品的空間。哈利六年級藏魔藥課本時其實已經見過它，當時尚未明白其意義。": "It is among the hidden objects in the Room of Requirement. Harry saw it when hiding his Potions book in sixth year.",
  "葛來分多的寶劍為何能摧毀分靈體？": "Why can the Sword of Gryffindor destroy Horcruxes?",
  "它吸收了蛇妖的毒液": "It absorbed Basilisk venom",
  "任何銀製武器都做得到": "Any silver weapon can do it",
  "只要由校長使用就可以": "It works whenever a headmaster uses it",
  "劍柄藏著重生石": "The Resurrection Stone is in its hilt",
  "妖精打造的寶劍只吸收能強化它的物質。哈利曾用它刺殺蛇妖，因此劍吸收了足以毀滅分靈體容器的蛇妖毒液。": "Goblin-made silver absorbs only what strengthens it. The sword absorbed Basilisk venom when Harry killed the serpent.",
  "在最後決戰前，哪一件事使接骨木魔杖的效忠從跩哥轉向哈利？": "What transfers the Elder Wand’s allegiance from Draco to Harry?",
  "哈利繼承鄧不利多的遺物": "Harry inherits Dumbledore’s belongings",
  "哈利折斷自己的冬青木魔杖": "Harry breaks his holly wand",
  "哈利在馬份莊園奪走跩哥的魔杖": "Harry takes Draco’s wand at Malfoy Manor",
