  "一副半月形眼鏡": "Half-moon spectacles",
  "重生石藏在哈利首次抓到的金探子中。哈利準備走進禁忌森林時，終於理解了如何讓它打開。": "The Stone is inside Harry’s first Snitch. He understands how to open it before entering the Forbidden Forest.",
  "石內卜「混血王子」的名字中，「王子」來自哪裡？": "Where does the ‘Prince’ in Snape’s nickname come from?",
  "母親婚前的姓氏 Prince": "His mother’s maiden name, Prince",
