  "史萊哲林的級長稱號": "A Slytherin prefect title",
  "他在決鬥比賽得到的稱號": "A duelling competition title",
  "石內卜的母親是女巫 Eileen Prince，父親則是麻瓜 Tobias Snape。他把自己的血統與母親的姓氏組成了「混血王子」這個名字。": "His mother is the witch Eileen Prince and his father is the Muggle Tobias Snape. The nickname combines his heritage and her surname.",
  "榮恩喝下有毒蜂蜜酒後，哈利用什麼救了他？": "How does Harry save Ron after he drinks poisoned mead?",
  "變身水": "Polyjuice Potion",
  "曼德拉草葉": "Mandrake leaves",
  "福來福喜": "Felix Felicis",
  "糞石（bezoar）": "A bezoar",
  "哈利想到混血王子在魔藥課本上的筆記，把糞石塞進榮恩嘴裡。它是取自山羊胃中的石狀物，能解多種毒。": "Remembering the Prince’s notes, Harry gives Ron a bezoar, a stone from a goat’s stomach that can counter many poisons.",
  "哈利透過雙面鏡碎片看見的藍眼睛，實際屬於誰？": "Whose blue eye does Harry see in the broken two-way mirror?",
