  "阿波佛買下另一面鏡子，藉此留意哈利的處境。看見求救後，他派多比前往馬份莊園。": "Aberforth owns the other mirror. He watches over Harry and sends Dobby to Malfoy Manor after the call for help.",
  "依《死神的聖物》小說，決戰結束後，哈利用接骨木魔杖完成哪一件事？": "In the Deathly Hallows novel, what does Harry do with the Elder Wand after the battle?",
