  "HarryPotter.com｜O.W.L.s 等第": "HarryPotter.com: O.W.L.s grades",
  "故事從英國展開。巫師與女巫生活在一般人——「麻瓜」——不知情的魔法社會中。斜角巷、魔法部與九又四分之三月台，讓熟悉的日常出現另一個入口。": "The story begins in Britain, where witches and wizards live in a society hidden from non-magical people, known as Muggles. Diagon Alley, the Ministry and Platform Nine and Three-Quarters open doors within the everyday world.",
  "霍格華茲魔法與巫術學院是哈利的學校，也是他第一次感受到歸屬的地方。四大學院各有重視的特質；課堂之外，友誼、選擇與勇氣同樣值得學習。": "Hogwarts School of Witchcraft and Wizardry is Harry’s school and his first real place of belonging. Its four houses value different qualities; beyond lessons, friendship, choices and courage also shape an education.",
  "J. K. 羅琳的七部原著，陪伴哈利從初識魔法走向面對責任。這份導覽以小說為主，帶你認識故事起點，並由你決定何時打開重大劇情。": "J. K. Rowling’s seven novels follow Harry from discovering magic to accepting responsibility. This guide focuses on the books and lets you choose when to reveal major spoilers.",
  "你好，我是藏書室站長。我將哈利波特七部小說的人物、神奇動物與故事介紹整理在這裡，希望讓初次閱讀或重溫系列的人，都能方便查找。": "Welcome to the reading room. I have gathered the characters, creatures and stories of the seven Harry Potter novels here, for first-time readers and those returning to the series.",
  "本站使用原創整理文字、AI 輔助城堡與奇獸插畫，以及 HarryPotter.com 人物電影照片；相關權利屬原權利人。": "This site uses original summaries, AI-assisted castle and creature illustrations, and character film photographs from HarryPotter.com. Relevant rights belong to their owners.",
  "介紹以七部小說為核心，以臺灣常見譯名呈現。下列官方資料可作為延伸閱讀；外部頁面可能包含劇情。": "This guide focuses on the seven novels. Chinese pages use names familiar to readers in Taiwan. These official references offer further reading and may contain spoilers.",
  "人物電影照片來自 HarryPotter.com 官方人物百科，各人物檔案均附來源連結；圖片權利歸原權利人。城堡與奇獸為 AI 輔助插畫。本站為非官方導覽，分院題目為本站原創娛樂設計，並非官方分類帽測驗。": "Character film photographs come from HarryPotter.com, with source links in each profile. Image rights belong to their owners. Castle and creature illustrations are AI-assisted. This is an unofficial guide with an original entertainment quiz, not the official Sorting Ceremony.",
  "O、E、A 為及格；P、D、T 為未及格。每題 1 分，不倒扣。等第名稱沿用小說，以下分數門檻及中文說明為本站設計。": "O, E and A are passing grades; P, D and T are failing grades. Each correct answer earns one point, with no penalties. Grade names come from the novels; numeric thresholds and descriptions are this site’s own adaptation.",
  "請啟用 JavaScript，以使用小說探索、圖鑑、分院與學生測驗。網站背景介紹仍可閱讀。": "Enable JavaScript to explore the books, creatures and quizzes. The background introduction remains readable.",
  "化獸形態": "Animagus form",
  "沿著七部小說的足跡，走進哈利波特的魔法世界。探索人物、神奇動物，體驗十六題分院儀式與三十題學生知識測驗。": "Explore the world of Harry Potter through seven novels, character profiles, magical creatures, a sixteen-question sorting quiz and a thirty-question student exam."
